00:34:52.200 --> 00:34:56.072
Raj Rajeshirke: Yeah, definitely that
is a big contest, uh, when it comes

00:34:56.073 --> 00:34:58.302
to, uh, accessibility conversations.

00:34:58.302 --> 00:35:02.346
Obviously somebody, uh, who has worked
hard on designing that product will

00:35:02.346 --> 00:35:06.692
not want to go back and rework things
